{
  "description": "用隔离网络内的 Streamable HTTP 服务验证添加多个 MCP、修改授权、断开和重连",
  "design": ["DESIGN.md", "design/components/list.md", "design/components/input.md", "design/components/select.md", "design/components/switch.md"],
